  (jv$clojure.core/attach-core-doc-meta! "clojure.core" "sort-by" "Returns a sorted sequence of the items in coll, where the sort\n  order is determined by comparing (keyfn item).  If no comparator is\n  supplied, uses compare.  comparator must implement\n  java.util.Comparator.  Guaranteed to be stable: equal elements will\n  not be reordered.  If coll is a Java array, it will be modified.  To\n  avoid this, sort a copy of the array." (jolt-list (jolt-vector (jolt-symbol #f "keyfn") (jolt-symbol #f "coll")) (jolt-vector (jolt-symbol #f "keyfn") (jolt-symbol #f "comp") (jolt-symbol #f "coll")))))
